<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine firms plan to buy up to 100,000 T corn.</title>
<headline>Philippine firms plan to buy up to 100,000 T corn.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group of Philippine feed millers plan to buy between 50,000 and 100,000 tonnes yellow corn for August arrival, an executive in one of the mills told Reuters on Friday.</p>
</text>
